		<description><![CDATA[<p>Lead text</p><IMG alt="cover" class="lead" SRC='https://images.example.test/summary.jpg?w=600&amp;h=400' /><img src="https://images.example.test/second.jpg">]]></description>
	</item>
	<item>
		<title>No image at all</title>
		<link>https://feed.example.test/news/no-image</link>
